==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈten.drəl/}}, {{SAMPA|/"tEn.dr@l/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{botany}} A specialized stem, leaf or petiole with a threadlike shape that is used by climbing plants for support and attachment, generally by twining around whatever it touches. 
# {{zoology}} A [[hair]]-like [[tentacle]].

